            "value": "Homodimer, also found as tetramers or higher oligomers (PubMed:12460581, PubMed:23601147, PubMed:3135462, PubMed:338303, PubMed:4566454, PubMed:8755860, PubMed:8913298, PubMed:9398522). Oligomerizes into higher-order complexes that form bridges between adjacent DNA helices. The N-terminal region (residues 1-64) can interact with overexpressed StpA (PubMed:8755860). Forms a complex with Cnu (YdgT) (PubMed:21600204). The H-NS dimer forms a heterotrimeric complex with Hha in the absence of DNA; this is mediated by residues 1-46 (PubMed:11790731, PubMed:16650431, PubMed:21600204, PubMed:26085102). Interacts with Hfq (PubMed:2020545)"
